## Command Palette

`Cmd+K` / `Ctrl+K` opens the universal command palette:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  🔍  Search commands and files...      │◄── focused
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  Recent                                      │
│  ├─ Launch Research Agent                    │
│  ├─ "Explain quantum computing"              │
│  └─ Switch to Gemini 2.0 Pro                 │
│                                              │
│  Programs                                    │
│  ├─ Chat — Start new conversation            │
│  ├─ Code Studio — Open code editor           │
│  ├─ Memory Vault — Browse knowledge          │
│  ├─ Image Forge — Generate image             │
│  ├─ Voice Nexus — Voice settings             │
│  ├─ AI Terminal — System shell               │
│  └─ Settings — System configuration          │
│                                              │
│  Commands                                    │
│  ├─ /clear — Clear current conversation      │
│  ├─ /export — Export conversation            │
│  ├─ /provider — Switch AI provider           │
│  └─ /help — Show all commands               │
│                                              │
│  Files                                       │
│  ├─ whyspace/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md            │
│  └─ whyspace/packages/frontend/src/          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Command Sources

| Source | Description |
|---|---|
| Built-in | System commands (`/clear`, `/help`) |
| Program | Commands exposed by individual programs |
| AI-generated | Dynamic commands based on context |
| Recent | Recently used commands and files |
| Searchable | Full-text search across all sources |

---

## Launchpad

The launchpad (accessible from taskbar or `Cmd+Space`) shows all installed programs:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  All Programs                          ✕    │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐       │
│  │ 💬  │ │ 💻  │ │ 🔬  │ │ 🧠  │       │
│  │ Chat │ │ Code │ │Research│ │Memory│       │
│  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘       │
│  ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐ ┌──────┐       │
│  │ 🎨  │ │ 🎤  │ │ ⚡  │ │ ⌨️  │       │
│  │ Image│ │ Voice│ │Wrkfl │ │Term  │       │
│  └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘ └──────┘       │
│                                              │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │  Install more programs...            │   │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────┘   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
|---|---|
| `Cmd+K` | Toggle command palette |
| `Cmd+Space` | Open launchpad |
| `Alt+Tab` | Cycle through open programs |
| `Cmd+W` | Close focused window |
| `Cmd+N` | New conversation (focused program) |
| `Cmd+Enter` | Send message (focused chat) |
| `Shift+Enter` | New line in input |
| `Cmd+Shift+V` | Toggle voice input |
| `Cmd+Shift+P` | Switch AI provider |
| `Cmd+,` | Open settings |
| `Escape` | Close modal / blur |
| `Cmd+1-9` | Switch to program N in taskbar |

---

## Visual Design Language

### Anti-Gravity Spatial UI

| Element | Behavior |
|---|---|
| **Floating panels** | Shadows, slight rotation on hover, magnetic edges |
| **Transitions** | Spring animations, smooth easing, no abrupt jumps |
| **Glass morphism** | Backdrop blur, subtle borders, frosted glass |
| **Depth layers** | Z-index creates atmospheric perspective |
| **Orbital indicators** | Loading states use orbital particle animations |
| **Holographic accents** | Cyan/violet glow, scan-line overlays |

### Color System

```
Primary:   Cyan (#00E5FF)
Secondary: Violet (#7C3AED)
Accent:    Amber (#FFB300)
Surface:   Dark (#0A0A1A)
Glass:     rgba(255,255,255,0.03)
Border:    rgba(0,229,255,0.2)
Text:      White (#FFFFFF)
Muted:     rgba(255,255,255,0.5)
Error:     Red (#FF4444)
Success:   Green (#00E676)
```

### Typography

| Usage | Font |
|---|---|
| UI labels, body | Inter / Outfit |
| Code | JetBrains Mono |
| Headlines, branding | Orbitron |
| Technical content | Space Grotesk |
